# Domain scope (always)

- One task → one domain. See root `AGENTS.md`.
- Prefer editing under the owning folder only; do not "drive-by" refactor other domains.
- Do **not** publish new npm libs unless reuse across apps is an explicit requirement.
- Dependency direction: `chat-ui` ↛ `host` internals; `tools` ↛ `chat-ui`; `providers` ↛ `tools`/`host`/`chat`.
- Host↔webview communication goes through `src/chat/protocol.ts` + `postMessage`, not by importing host modules into the webview graph.
